{
  "id": "1042",
  "title": "Chinese People Like To Give Fruit",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-08-22",
  "synopsis": "Fruit is a nice gift.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1042/3a64342fa2f8cd0dc92c069cb29f450464946f05.mp3?1595237174",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "中国人喜欢送水果\n\n    在中国，朋友住院的时候，我们会买一些水果去医院看我们的朋友。去别人家做客的时候，我们也会买水果。因为水果对身体很好，也不贵，所以中国人喜欢送水果。",
    "traditional": "中國人喜歡送水果\n\n    在中國，朋友住院的時候，我們會買一些水果去醫院看我們的朋友。去別人家做客的時候，我們也會買水果。因為水果對身體很好，也不貴，所以中國人喜歡送水果。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Chinese People Like to Give Fruit"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "在中国，朋友住院的时候，我们会买一些水果去医院看我们的朋友。",
      "traditional": "在中國，朋友住院的時候，我們會買一些水果去醫院看我們的朋友。",
      "pinyin": "zài zhōng guó péng you zhù yuàn de shí hou wǒ men huì mǎi yì xiē shuǐ guǒ qù yī yuàn kàn wǒ men de péng you",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "去别人家做客的时候，我们也会买水果。",
      "traditional": "去別人家做客的時候，我們也會買水果。",
      "pinyin": "qù bié ren jiā zuò kè de shí hou wǒ men yě huì mǎi shuǐ guǒ",
      "english": "In China, when a friend is in hospital, we will buy some fruit to take with us to the hospital when we visit our friend."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "因为水果对身体很好，也不贵，所以中国人喜欢送水果。",
      "traditional": "因為水果對身體很好，也不貴，所以中國人喜歡送水果。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi shuǐ guǒ duì shēn tǐ hěn hǎo yě bú guì suǒ yǐ zhōng guó rén xǐ huan sòng shuǐ guǒ",
      "english": "When we visit other people’s homes as guests, we will also buy fruit."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Because fruit is very good for one’s health, and is also inexpensive, Chinese people like to give fruit as a gift."
    }
  ],
